e&#34;&gt;│   ├── flutter/                   # 业主端 Flutter Web（PC 风格）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;│   └── harmonyos/                 # 业主端 HarmonyOS App&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;└── docs/                          # 项目文档&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;    ├── ARCHITECTURE.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;    ├── ARCHITECTURE_DESIGN.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;    ├── API.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;    ├── FEATURES.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;    └── FEATURE_DESIGN.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
